# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVATE KEY AND SIGNING MATERIAL
#
# Added while setting up iOS signing, which involves generating an RSA key on
# this machine and downloading a .p8 from Apple. Neither belongs in a repository,
# and both are easy to create in the project directory by accident — `ssh-keygen`
# writes to wherever you happen to be standing.
#
# These live in Codemagic's environment variables instead, which is why nothing
# in codemagic.yaml holds a value, only names.
#
# A rule here does NOT protect a file already tracked. Nothing matching these
# patterns was tracked when they were added; that was checked, not assumed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
cert_key
cert_key.pub
*.p8
*.pem
*.p12
*.cer
*.mobileprovision

# Badge generator API key — never committed.
badge-image-generator/.env
